update  hello
~ image: sha256:bbbbbbbbbbbb... (linux/arm64) -> sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaa...
(linux/arm64)
- domain: old.example.com
+ domain: hello.example.com
~ host port: 21000 -> 20000
~ container port: 4000 -> 3000
~ resources: 256 MiB, 64 PIDs -> 512 MiB, 128 PIDs
~ health: / status 200, startup 15s, timeout 2s -> /ready status 200, startup
30s, timeout 3s
- env REMOVED: removed
+ env ADDED: added (value hidden)
~ env APP_ENV: changed (value hidden)
~ secret TOKEN: hello-token [brine-hello-hello-token-v1] -> hello-token [brine-
hello-hello-token-v2]
+ allocate host port 20000
~ pull and verify image sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaa...
~ bind secret TOKEN -> hello-token
~ render app service
~ routing generation: 2 -> 3
~ restart app
